WEBVTT

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:00.076
Alex's new start-up, Cocoon,

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.339
has developed an app
for communicating privately

00:16:02.363 --> 00:16:04.708
with our closest friends and families.

00:16:04.732 --> 00:16:05.926
Before the pandemic,

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:08.656
the team was six people
in the same physical space

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:10.666
while one person was remote.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.476
Now they're all remote.

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:15.576
AC: We have brought on at Cocoon

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:18.716
two new team members since this began,

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:21.636
and they need to be
onboarded to the company,

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:24.886
to the product and to what we do
and what we believe in.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:26.690
AG: He's instinctively put into place

00:16:26.714 --> 00:16:29.866
some of the core strategies
that Martine Haas recommends.

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:31.566
To strengthen shared identity,